      <p>A snapped torsion or extension spring brings your door to a complete stop—and it rarely gives a warning first. We carry high-cycle replacement springs for both residential and heavy-duty applications, replace both springs at once so one failure doesn't lead to another, and balance the door before we leave. Shepherd is 15 minutes from Rosebush, so same-day service is very often possible.</p>
