    </a>

    <a href="/services/opener-repair" class="core-services-card opener">
      <h3>Opener Repair & Installation</h3>
      <p>Grinding, reversing unexpectedly, running but not moving the door, or completely unresponsive—opener failures show up in a lot of different ways. We diagnose them accurately and fix them fast. We service all major brands and can install a new smart opener with Wi-Fi control when the old one isn't worth saving. A remote-access opener is a practical upgrade for any property where you're in and out frequently.</p>
    </a>
